Notebook[{
Cell["NullHomotopicQ", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"96d99f42-4a65-4c90-86c0-2d75be198ebc"],

Cell["[LLM Generated]", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"42382a8f-3624-4d31-8928-c98c1e5cbf2f"],

Cell["\<\
NullHomotopicQ[graph, cycle] tests whether a closed walk is null-homotopic. \
Accepts a bare closed walk (auto-closed via {cycle, First[cycle]}), an \
InfraLoop[{...}], InfraString[{...}], or InfraCircle[{...}] \
(Cartesian-AllTrue over realisations). Inherits FindInfraHomotopy options.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8b06ea5b-171d-4816-84b2-3d7b13b1ae13"],

